ecause you're like the  first audience of something  [Music]  as an arab american woman i feel like so  much of my career has been about  representing the underrepresented and to  be able to do that now in the deaf  community i just was so honored  [Music]  i think it opens up a broader world for  what we expect from television i think  the bar is being raised because we're  seeing that this works really really  well  [Music]  [Music]  you

